OL,3,GNEWSABreaking the link between booze
OL,4,Aand rugby
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains details
OL,7,Fwhich some readers may find
OL,8,Fdistressing.
OL,10,FJames Hayward knew from a young age
OL,11,Fthat drinking alcohol made him popular,
OL,12,Fwhich in turn, made him happy.
OL,14,FHe had his first taste of alcohol at
OL,15,F10-years-old, and the would later find
OL,16,Fhimself drinking at any given
OL,17,Fopportunity.
