OL,3,GNEWSABreaking the link between booze
OL,4,Aand rugby
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter quitting university, being caught
OL,7,Fdrink-driving while training to be a
OL,8,Fpolice officer, and trying to take his
OL,9,Fown life after a night at the pub, he
OL,10,Fknew he had to make a change - and now
OL,11,Fruns a sober rugby team a year after
OL,12,Fhis last drink.
